    <item>
      <title>Red Gum Angled Speaker Stands</title>
      <link>https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 17 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Angled speaker stands made of RedGum and merbau.
Designed for the tweeter to aim at ear height 2m from the speaker.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;lb&#34; href=&#34;https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I01_hu_a357bbbe855c38ab.webp&#34; data-pswp-width=&#34;1610&#34; data-pswp-height=&#34;1227&#34; aria-label=&#34;Enlarge: Red Gum Angled Speaker Stands – build photo 1&#34;&gt;
&lt;picture&gt;
  &lt;source type=&#34;image/avif&#34; srcset=&#34;https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I01_hu_849e81c5c31b3fa1.avif 480w, https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I01_hu_62017ea4d47961a5.avif 800w, https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I01_hu_8a05966ca8a81be6.avif 1200w&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1000px&#34;&gt;
  &lt;source type=&#34;image/webp&#34; srcset=&#34;https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I01_hu_62c3d5fe4686752d.webp 480w, https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I01_hu_8e5f30edbb38c1b0.webp 800w, https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I01_hu_91f2da669f020bd8.webp 1200w&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1000px&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img src=&#34;https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I01_hu_c1eee6f2ec443767.jpg&#34; width=&#34;1200&#34; height=&#34;915&#34; alt=&#34;Red Gum Angled Speaker Stands – build photo 1&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;35x35mm merbau beams are used for the quad vertical posts.
The merbau posts are primed and coated in Duplicolor matte black. They are cut at a 7 degree angle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;lb&#34; href=&#34;https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I02_hu_c978f6af96ee800.webp&#34; data-pswp-width=&#34;1598&#34; data-pswp-height=&#34;1217&#34; aria-label=&#34;Enlarge: Red Gum Angled Speaker Stands – build photo 2&#34;&gt;
&lt;picture&gt;
  &lt;source type=&#34;image/avif&#34; srcset=&#34;https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I02_hu_52c6d07ff7b29858.avif 480w, https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I02_hu_be1df234e159f71.avif 800w, https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I02_hu_6cee0ba79acb43cf.avif 1200w&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1000px&#34;&gt;
  &lt;source type=&#34;image/webp&#34; srcset=&#34;https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I02_hu_aecb5eb09edb5bfa.webp 480w, https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I02_hu_131ade0d56ad0d9f.webp 800w, https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I02_hu_ebb5176562205929.webp 1200w&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1000px&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img src=&#34;https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I02_hu_45ab11d7359e440.jpg&#34; width=&#34;1200&#34; height=&#34;914&#34; alt=&#34;Red Gum Angled Speaker Stands – build photo 2&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;90x14mm Red Gum lengths are laminated length and depth wise to create 28mm panels.
Check the fitment with the posts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;lb&#34; href=&#34;https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I03_hu_766dd31e7114f780.webp&#34; data-pswp-width=&#34;1118&#34; data-pswp-height=&#34;1467&#34; aria-label=&#34;Enlarge: Red Gum Angled Speaker Stands – build photo 3&#34;&gt;
&lt;picture&gt;
  &lt;source type=&#34;image/avif&#34; srcset=&#34;https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I03_hu_3108b67a9aec2e5d.avif 480w, https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I03_hu_6e5d3cf76beed122.avif 800w&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1000px&#34;&gt;
  &lt;source type=&#34;image/webp&#34; srcset=&#34;https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I03_hu_f7b3652071ef93a7.webp 480w, https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I03_hu_a8d1fbb15210aeb3.webp 800w&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1000px&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img src=&#34;https://riganti.com.au/build/speaker/I03_hu_8d1677e4355d24c4.jpg&#34; width=&#34;800&#34; height=&#34;1050&#34; alt=&#34;Red Gum Angled Speaker Stands – build photo 3&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sand the panels with 80, 150 and then 240 grit sandpaper.
Apply 3 coats of Danish oil spaced a day apart.
Wait a week till it is completely dry, then apply 4-5 coats of Minwax wipe on satin poly.&lt;/p&gt;
